SELECT ci.id, 'The LCCI office timings have been rescheduled for the Holy month of Ramazan. During the Holy Month of Ramazan, the LCCI would remain open from 9:00 a.m. to 3:00 p.m without any break while on Fridays the LCCI would work from 9:00 a.m. to 12:00 p.m.', '<p>The LCCI office timings have been rescheduled for the Holy month of Ramazan. During the Holy Month of Ramazan, the LCCI would remain open from 9:00 a.m. to 3:00 p.m without any break while on Fridays the LCCI would work from 9:00 a.m. to 12:00 p.m.</p>

